                 "step_number": "1",
                "instruction": "Use the `content` property on pseudo-elements (`::before` or `::after`) to insert hidden strings that act as meta-messages within the page. Be sure to target specific areas with specific messages by selecting for elements that have certain data-attributes. ",
               },
                  {
                "step_number":"2",
             "instruction": "Use the color, background-color, font-size, and line-height properties to embed subtle changes in style that can be used to deliver targeted messages or numerical values that can be read by a bot. Changes may be almost invisible to the human eye. Be consistent in your formatting for best results. "
               },
                  {
               "step_number":"3",
                    "instruction":"Employ the transform property to rotate, translate, or scale an element based on a specific pattern or number that can be used by the bot to encode data or instructions."
             },
             {
           "step_number":"4",
                "instruction":"Use the z-index property, with transparent elements that contain a message using the CSS `content` property, creating an encoded message that requires layer-by-layer decoding."
        },
            {
              "step_number":"5",
             "instruction": "Use the animation-delay property in combination with JavaScript triggers to create messages that unfold based on a timeline, setting specific triggers for unique patterns of communication."
          },
